<title>USA: GRC gets 5-year contract worth up $25 mln.</title>
<headline>GRC gets 5-year contract worth up $25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International Inc said Friday it got a defense contract with a possible maximum value of $25 million over five years.</p>
<p>The contract is for technical support services to develop the joint warfare system JWARS, which analyzes and simulates military campaigns. It was awarded by the Office of the Secretary of Defense.</p>
<p>CACI International Inc, of Arlington, Va., said May 19 it received a similar five-year contract, also capped at $25 million.</p>
</text>
